ModMetaData.description:
Dead and downed pawns keep their weapons and inventory instead of bursting into loot. Strip them the vanilla way.

With Anomaly: shamblers raised from armed pawns keep their weapons. Each shambler gets an intellect level (global setting plus random spread) that decides what it can do:
- mindless: vanilla, weapon is dropped;
- brawler: keeps melee weapons;
- gunner: keeps any weapon, shoots from short range;
- tactician: looks for firing positions and cover, picks up better weapons it passes by.

If Non Uno Pinata is active, its item handling is used and this mod's own item-keeping is switched off.
